note right of IImageCropperFacility
  Implemented by the consuming project.
  The library decodes no image format
  of its own.
end note

note bottom of LibraryFacade
  The only entry point a consuming
  project needs. Everything else stays
  behind these abstract interfaces.
end note

note bottom of ImageLoader
  Preloads the web hosted image
  records into a local cache before
  they are copied or cropped.
end note

